/T (The Library Management System is a Java-based desktop application developed to simplify and organize the management of books and library members. The system provides a user-friendly graphical interface through which users can add, view, update, and delete book and member information.)
/E (The Library Management System is a Java-based desktop application developed to simplify and organize the management of books and library members. The system provides a user-friendly graphical interface through which users can add, view, update, and delete book and member information.)
