/T (The application is developed using Java Swing, Object-Oriented Programming \(OOP\) principles, and file handling for data storage. It also includes input validation, exception handling, and report generation features. The system stores book and member information in text files, allowing the data to remain available after the application is closed and reopened.)
/E (The application is developed using Java Swing, Object-Oriented Programming \(OOP\) principles, and file handling for data storage. It also includes input validation, exception handling, and report generation features. The system stores book and member information in text files, allowing the data to remain available after the application is closed and reopened.)
