/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 89 0 R
/T (The project aims to apply fundamental Java programming and Object-Oriented Programming \(OOP\) concepts in a practical software project. It focuses on implementing encapsulation, abstraction, inheritance, and polymorphism, along with file handling, input validation, exception handling, and persistent data storage. Another goal is to provide proper error and success messages so that users can interact with the system easily and correctly.)
/E (The project aims to apply fundamental Java programming and Object-Oriented Programming \(OOP\) concepts in a practical software project. It focuses on implementing encapsulation, abstraction, inheritance, and polymorphism, along with file handling, input validation, exception handling, and persistent data storage. Another goal is to provide proper error and success messages so that users can interact with the system easily and correctly.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [8]
>>
