/E (Managing books and member information manually can make it difficult to maintain, update, and retrieve library records efficiently. This project was developed to provide a simple computerized system where book and member information can be stored, viewed, updated, and deleted in an organized manner. The system also provides validation, error handling, and report generation to make common library management tasks more structured and convenient.)
