183 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 91 0 R
/T (The system provides book and member management functionalities through a graphical user interface. The main features include adding, viewing, updating, and deleting records, input validation, duplicate Member ID prevention, custom exception handling, file-based data persistence, error and success messages, and library report generation. The system also allows users to view the total number of books and members through the generated report.)
/E (The system provides book and member management functionalities through a graphical user interface. The main features include adding, viewing, updating, and deleting records, input validation, duplicate Member ID prevention, custom exception handling, file-based data persistence, error and success messages, and library report generation. The system also allows users to view the total number of books and members through the generated report.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [25]
>>
endobj
