185 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 91 0 R
/T (The major classes of the system are organized into different components. The Main class serves as the entry point of the application. The model package contains Person, Member, and Book. The file package contains FileManager for file operations, while the exception package contains InvalidDataException for handling invalid data. The gui package contains MainFrame, AddBookPanel, ViewBookPanel, AddMemberPanel, ViewMemberPanel, UpdateMemberPanel, DeleteMemberPanel, and ReportPanel for the graphical user interface.)
/E (The major classes of the system are organized into different components. The Main class serves as the entry point of the application. The model package contains Person, Member, and Book. The file package contains FileManager for file operations, while the exception package contains InvalidDataException for handling invalid data. The gui package contains MainFrame, AddBookPanel, ViewBookPanel, AddMemberPanel, ViewMemberPanel, UpdateMemberPanel, DeleteMemberPanel, and ReportPanel for the graphical user interface.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [27]
>>
endobj
