/Title (The Library Management System was successfully developed as a Java-based desktop application using Java Swing, Object-Oriented Programming, file handling, and exception handling. The system provides book and member management, CRUD operations, input validation, persistent file-based data storage, and library report generation through a graphical user interface.)
