/Title (The major objectives of the project were achieved. The system successfully implements the required book and member management functionalities and demonstrates the major OOP concepts of Encapsulation, Abstraction, Inheritance, and Polymorphism. The completed system was also tested across its main functionalities, including validation, CRUD operations, GUI interaction, and report generation.)
/Dest [23 0 R /Fit]
