726 0 obj
<<
/Title (The project aims to develop a simple, user-friendly, and functional Library Management System that can efficiently manage library books and members through a graphical user interface. It is designed to reduce the complexity of maintaining library records manually and provide an organized way to perform common library management activities.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 677 0 R
>>
endobj
