728 0 obj
<<
/Title (The system implements Create, Read, Update, and Delete \(CRUD\) operations for books and library members. It allows users to add and view book and member records, update existing member information, and delete member records. The system also provides input validation, prevents duplicate member IDs, handles invalid data through custom exception handling, stores records using text files, and generates a library report containing book and member information with their total counts.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 678 0 R
>>
endobj
