<<
/Title (The system provides book and member management functionalities through a graphical user interface. The main features include adding, viewing, updating, and deleting records, input validation, duplicate Member ID prevention, custom exception handling, file-based data persistence, error and success messages, and library report generation. The system also allows users to view the total number of books and members through the generated report.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 780 0 R
>>
endobj
