<<
/Title (The workflow begins when the user runs the application through the Main class. The MainFrame then displays the available library management options. The user can select the required operation, such as adding or viewing books and members, updating or deleting member records, or generating a report. The system validates the entered information and performs the requested operation through the appropriate GUI and file-handling components. The updated information is stored in the corresponding text files, and the generated report is saved in library_report.txt.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 790 0 R
>>
endobj
